      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just so tired of going to the doctor every week for these checkups... it feels like overkill. do u think it could just be my blood pressure being a bit high from all the stress? like is there anything i can do at home to just help the swelling go down so i dont have to deal with the hospital stuff right now?",
